<LegalLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Privacy Policy"
  eyebrow="Site document"
  description="Privacy policy for the Puri Saren Ubud guide: data collected, how it is used, third-party services, consent basis, and your rights."
>
  <p>We follow a minimal data-collection principle. This site has no user accounts, customer database, or booking system.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Technical browsing data needed to serve and secure the site, such as IP address, browser type, and requested pages, as available through the site’s hosting infrastructure.</li>
    <li>Cookies or similar storage needed to remember your consent choices.</li>
    <li>Analytics data only if you enable the analytics category.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How we use information</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>To serve and improve content and the user experience.</li>
    <li>To analyse aggregate traffic patterns if analytics consent is given.</li>
    <li>To keep the site secure and meet applicable legal obligations.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Third-party services</h2>
  <p>This page may use Google Maps for maps and location data. Google Analytics loads only after you grant analytics consent. Photos are sourced from Unsplash under the Unsplash Licence, but the main files are served from this site and do not require Unsplash scripts.</p>

  <h2>Consent basis and storage</h2>
  <p>The site tries to store your Cookie Choices on your device so it can remember the decision; browser storage limits may prevent this. Non-essential analytics are off by default. You can change the decision anytime via the <a href="/en/cookie-settings/">Cookie Settings</a> page.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>If GDPR or another data-protection regulation applies to your processing, relevant rights may include access, correction, deletion, restriction or objection to processing, and complaint to the competent supervisory authority. This site does not yet provide a contact form or dedicated request channel.</p>

  <h2>External links</h2>
  <p>When you open Google Maps or an official source site, you leave this site and that party’s privacy policy applies.</p>
</LegalLayout>
